{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-01-20 06:55:00', 'title': 'FIS APPOINTS LEE ADREAN AND MARK BENJAMIN AS INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FIS (NYSE: FIS) (“FIS” OR THE “COMPANY”), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FINANCIAL SERVICES TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENTS OF LEE ADREAN AND MARK BENJAMIN TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”), EFFECTIVE JANUARY 20, 2023."}